1
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:09,480
[The seeker entered the room]

2
00:00:11,383 --> 00:00:13,261
It’s not in here.

3
00:00:26,463 --> 00:00:28,882
[Glanced around the cabinet and walked away]

4
00:00:29,464 --> 00:00:30,705
He's left.

5
00:00:32,476 --> 00:00:34,807
[SION remains trapped in the confinement room]

6
00:00:38,076 --> 00:00:39,824
[(The angle a straight line makes...)]

7
00:00:39,825 --> 00:00:41,325
Is it seventy degrees?

8
00:00:47,137 --> 00:00:49,559
[JAEHEE finally shows up]
SION!

9
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:52,146
– Oh! It’s a protractor!
– I got it.

10
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:53,569
I’m gonna make a run for it again.

11
00:00:56,581 --> 00:00:58,102
JAEHEE, that was awesome.

12
00:01:00,244 --> 00:01:02,505
Wait, it really is seventy.

13
00:01:02,506 --> 00:01:05,363
[SION]

14
00:01:06,114 --> 00:01:08,224
SION can’t afford to be caught.

15
00:01:08,732 --> 00:01:10,604
[Just when SION manages to break out]

16
00:01:10,605 --> 00:01:12,702
I have to move! Seriously, I need to go!

17
00:01:12,703 --> 00:01:14,667
Let’s go now!

18
00:01:17,389 --> 00:01:19,435
No way.

19
00:01:21,574 --> 00:01:23,918
Someone will rescue him, probably.

20
00:01:25,188 --> 00:01:28,818
[Fighting the battle solo once again]
Should I move? Should I go?

21
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:33,090
I can’t do this all by myself.

22
00:01:34,305 --> 00:01:35,940
Gotta save SION.

23
00:01:36,357 --> 00:01:37,548
Don’t want to do it alone.

24
00:01:37,549 --> 00:01:39,040
I really hate this, I’m scared.

25
00:01:39,853 --> 00:01:41,575
Move! Let’s go!

26
00:01:42,219 --> 00:01:43,680
I need to pee.

27
00:01:44,289 --> 00:01:47,633
I’m really scared, what should I do?

28
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,503
I’ve got to move. Let’s go!

29
00:01:51,504 --> 00:01:53,035
I'm going for it!

30
00:01:53,036 --> 00:01:54,412
Let’s just move.

31
00:01:54,413 --> 00:01:57,015
[SAKUYA musters up the courage]

32
00:02:00,997 --> 00:02:03,627
Let’s rescue SION and then come back here.

33
00:02:11,606 --> 00:02:14,655
[Faced with danger right after stepping outside]

34
00:02:24,348 --> 00:02:28,881
[The sound keeps drawing nearer]

35
00:02:56,426 --> 00:02:58,891
[SAKUYA has been spotted!]

36
00:03:00,087 --> 00:03:02,872
I’m really sorry.

37
00:03:06,503 --> 00:03:09,476
[SAKUYA]

38
00:03:09,843 --> 00:03:11,985
[SION has exited the confinement room]

39
00:03:12,689 --> 00:03:15,322
[Rushing off somewhere in a hurry]

40
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:25,807
I can just keep escaping like this.

41
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,212
[YUSHI]
[Another thinker stationed here]

42
00:03:32,185 --> 00:03:33,786
I don’t think they’ll catch me.

43
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:36,720
[Staying perfectly hidden and still]
This is easy.

44
00:03:36,934 --> 00:03:40,462
[(Same tactic)]
I’ll try my best to hide.

45
00:03:40,951 --> 00:03:43,134
I’ll stay put right here.

46
00:03:43,135 --> 00:03:44,968
For NCTzen's sake.

47
00:03:45,699 --> 00:03:49,165
I’ll present NCTzen with something big.

48
00:03:49,685 --> 00:03:52,404
[Second floor of the Learning Center]

49
00:03:52,405 --> 00:03:53,711
I’m terrified.

50
00:03:53,712 --> 00:03:55,381
[RYO begins scouting for a hiding spot]

51
00:03:55,382 --> 00:03:56,981
I’m seriously scared.

52
00:03:59,712 --> 00:04:04,990
[JAEHEE is already in the changing room RYO had marked]

53
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:08,248
Why are you after me?

54
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:12,549
[The two prepare to leave the classroom together]

55
00:04:12,828 --> 00:04:15,277
[RYO notices something]

56
00:04:15,746 --> 00:04:18,043
[(Gripped the light tightly)]

57
00:04:23,615 --> 00:04:24,893
[(Signals there’s nothing inside)]

58
00:04:26,088 --> 00:04:28,505
[Embarrassed chuckle]

59
00:04:28,915 --> 00:04:31,685
[SAKUYA remains locked up]

60
00:04:32,523 --> 00:04:34,246
How am I supposed to do this...

61
00:04:34,721 --> 00:04:40,280
['Sakuya’s challenge']
[Using the school supplies, erase everything that’s not “WISH”]

62
00:04:40,649 --> 00:04:43,078
Was that you? Did you save SION?

63
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:45,229
Yeah, it was me.

64
00:04:45,567 --> 00:04:47,901
– What if he gets caught again?
– He only gets one shot.

65
00:04:47,902 --> 00:04:49,164
– Is that it?
– Yeah, that’s it.

66
00:04:49,165 --> 00:04:49,868
Got it.

67
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:51,329
Who’s in here?

68
00:04:51,569 --> 00:04:53,887
[Just as they mention SION, he shows up]
Me!

69
00:04:53,888 --> 00:04:55,581
Did you grab all the school supplies? Even YUSHI’s?

70
00:04:55,582 --> 00:04:56,949
Not sure, I just got yours for now.

71
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,648
Let’s get out of here then.

72
00:04:58,875 --> 00:05:01,195
JAEHEE, it’s just you and me now.

73
00:05:01,196 --> 00:05:03,154
As long as one more survives, we’re good.

74
00:05:03,155 --> 00:05:03,845
Right.

75
00:05:04,753 --> 00:05:06,123
Let’s just run away.

76
00:05:06,124 --> 00:05:07,365
Okay.

77
00:05:08,393 --> 00:05:10,444
Let’s head downstairs first.

78
00:05:12,348 --> 00:05:15,047
[RYO sneaks behind the changing room after sending the others away]

79
00:05:15,048 --> 00:05:19,676
If I do this, some light might still come through.

80
00:05:20,613 --> 00:05:24,553
But this might hide us well enough.

81
00:05:29,857 --> 00:05:35,613
[They’ll move based on the seeker’s sound]
– You stay here and listen for the crutch. I’ll listen over there.
– Got it.

82
00:05:35,614 --> 00:05:38,452
[SION]

83
00:05:38,453 --> 00:05:41,236
[JAEHEE]

84
00:05:42,289 --> 00:05:43,551
[Seeker’s staff hitting the floor]

85
00:05:43,552 --> 00:05:46,535
[Seeker shows up right on cue]

86
00:05:48,317 --> 00:05:49,613
Here they come.

87
00:05:51,512 --> 00:05:52,960
I can hear them from here too.

88
00:05:54,793 --> 00:05:56,440
Take it slow.

89
00:05:56,441 --> 00:05:58,103
Just listen closely.

90
00:05:58,383 --> 00:06:01,233
[Where the seeker is heading now]

91
00:06:01,484 --> 00:06:07,573
[2F: Seeker / RYO]
[1F: SION, JAEHEE]
[RYO is currently on 2F of the Learning Center]

92
00:06:11,901 --> 00:06:14,120
[RYO]
Someone’s coming?

93
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:16,396
Someone just arrived.

94
00:06:21,085 --> 00:06:25,817
[Seeker thoroughly scans the classroom]

95
00:06:44,145 --> 00:06:46,450
[Even opens up the changing room]

96
00:06:49,278 --> 00:06:52,149
[RYO remains unseen behind the changing room]

97
00:07:12,985 --> 00:07:15,103
[RYO makes a small noise]

98
00:07:19,579 --> 00:07:24,565
[Heads back toward the changing room]

99
00:07:30,348 --> 00:07:32,526
[Found you! RYO]

100
00:07:32,527 --> 00:07:33,686
Hold up.

101
00:07:33,687 --> 00:07:34,905
I’m scared.

102
00:07:35,626 --> 00:07:39,348
[RYO]

103
00:07:39,349 --> 00:07:41,132
RYO’s been caught.

104
00:07:41,378 --> 00:07:42,937
What should I do now?

105
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:45,791
Oh man.

106
00:07:45,792 --> 00:07:47,689
Go, RYO!

107
00:07:48,998 --> 00:07:53,458
What? How did RYO get caught?

108
00:07:53,953 --> 00:07:56,380
[RYO and SAKUYA reunited in the confinement room]
You don’t have that thing?

109
00:07:56,381 --> 00:07:57,443
The thing to unlock this?

110
00:07:57,866 --> 00:07:58,562
I have it.

111
00:07:58,563 --> 00:07:59,405
– You do?
– Yeah.

112
00:08:01,515 --> 00:08:02,616
Huh?

113
00:08:02,617 --> 00:08:06,091
Planning to stay here as long as I can and sneak out at the end.

114
00:08:06,545 --> 00:08:08,189
Smart move.

115
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:12,690
[Learning Center 3F, RIKU / 2F, SAKUYA, RYO]
[1F, SION, JAEHEE]
If we hear the seeker, we’ll have to go up or down.

116
00:08:12,691 --> 00:08:14,630
[SION and JAEHEE hide near the stairs]

117
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,857
[Sound of the seeker’s staff]

118
00:08:18,858 --> 00:08:23,861
[Learning Center 2F, Seeker / 1F, SION, JAEHEE]

119
00:08:23,862 --> 00:08:25,193
Right above us.

120
00:08:26,056 --> 00:08:27,905
It’s just above us, JAEHEE.

121
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:34,815
I hear footsteps on the stairs.

122
00:08:35,265 --> 00:08:37,537
[Sound of descending footsteps]

123
00:08:42,897 --> 00:08:45,979
[They flee right before running into the seeker]

124
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:52,550
Go upstairs.

125
00:08:52,551 --> 00:08:54,403
Why is the seeker so tall?

126
00:09:01,077 --> 00:09:03,120
We can’t stay here, we need to go down.

127
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,418
He's headed this way.

128
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:14,261
[SION / Seeker]
[Barely miss each other]

129
00:09:14,565 --> 00:09:17,202
[SION makes a move]

130
00:09:17,613 --> 00:09:19,260
[The seeker also heads downstairs after spotting him]

131
00:09:26,896 --> 00:09:28,387
[SION starts going down one more floor]

132
00:09:35,525 --> 00:09:37,764
[Suddenly switches direction and heads up]

133
00:09:39,942 --> 00:09:41,840
[Which way will the seeker go?]

134
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:53,017
[Chooses to go down]

135
00:09:53,599 --> 00:09:57,744
[SION manages to survive again]

136
00:10:03,328 --> 00:10:05,038
[RIKU]
I’m scared, but this place should be alright.

137
00:10:05,042 --> 00:10:06,367
[RIKU]
I’m nervous, but I feel like this spot is safe.

138
00:10:06,368 --> 00:10:08,608
Could this place be alright?

139
00:10:09,267 --> 00:10:11,882
[RIKU locked himself inside the cabinet]

140
00:10:11,883 --> 00:10:15,261
[Waging a battle against sweat]

141
00:10:15,733 --> 00:10:18,210
The sweat’s becoming a serious problem.

142
00:10:22,210 --> 00:10:23,483
It’s boiling in here.

143
00:10:25,025 --> 00:10:27,050
Feels like I’m inside a steam room.

144
00:10:28,161 --> 00:10:30,267
My legs are killing me.

145
00:10:32,801 --> 00:10:34,352
My legs feel sore.

146
00:10:34,353 --> 00:10:36,241
My legs really hurt.

147
00:10:37,363 --> 00:10:39,135
What should I do?

148
00:10:39,886 --> 00:10:40,842
It’s so hot, I can’t take it.

149
00:10:40,843 --> 00:10:42,656
Hot and my legs are hurting too.

150
00:10:45,394 --> 00:10:47,424
[Phone alert sound]

151
00:10:47,425 --> 00:10:49,374
Did someone get found?

152
00:10:50,074 --> 00:10:52,531
Someone’s been caught.

153
00:10:54,216 --> 00:10:58,400
‘Once the remaining time hits 2,222 seconds’

154
00:10:58,401 --> 00:11:01,317
‘the seeker will vanish for a short while.’

155
00:11:01,318 --> 00:11:04,374
[You’ll have four minutes to hide more securely]

156
00:11:04,375 --> 00:11:07,582
‘After four minutes’

157
00:11:07,583 --> 00:11:09,567
‘there will be two seekers instead of one.’

158
00:11:10,273 --> 00:11:12,692
[So make sure to hide yourself better]

159
00:11:12,693 --> 00:11:14,808
I had a feeling this would happen.

160
00:11:21,494 --> 00:11:24,159
[The seeker temporarily vanishes]

161
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:27,290
Is this the time when we should hide better?

162
00:11:27,291 --> 00:11:29,901
Maybe I should just stay hidden here?

163
00:11:31,237 --> 00:11:32,935
What am I supposed to do now?

164
00:11:32,936 --> 00:11:35,613
What’s the best choice here?

165
00:11:35,614 --> 00:11:38,005
[The seeker appears again]

166
00:11:38,006 --> 00:11:41,157
Probably best to stay hidden here, right?

167
00:11:41,614 --> 00:11:42,302
You should run now.

168
00:11:42,303 --> 00:11:43,159
Me? Got it.

169
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,822
I think we need to split up.

170
00:11:44,823 --> 00:11:46,366
I’ll make sure I stay out of sight.

171
00:11:49,733 --> 00:11:52,514
[SION and JAEHEE decide to split and hide separately]

172
00:11:54,834 --> 00:11:56,233
[RIKU exits the cabinet]

173
00:11:56,697 --> 00:11:59,312
[Blocks the door with a chair]

174
00:12:00,853 --> 00:12:02,711
[Also locks the door connecting to the other room]

175
00:12:04,043 --> 00:12:07,208
[Returns to his original hiding position]

176
00:12:13,085 --> 00:12:17,051
Hide well, stay hidden.

177
00:12:18,838 --> 00:12:21,251
[SION hides inside a trash bin by the staircase]

178
00:12:21,845 --> 00:12:23,867
[JAEHEE sneaks into an especially dark lab room]

179
00:12:23,868 --> 00:12:27,300
Tuck in or your hair might give you away.

180
00:12:28,918 --> 00:12:31,449
I can’t find a hiding place.

181
00:12:31,983 --> 00:12:34,104
I found one.

182
00:12:34,105 --> 00:12:37,234
[The seeker shows up again]
Stay hidden.

183
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:39,588
There are

184
00:12:39,589 --> 00:12:41,740
two seekers now.

185
00:12:42,218 --> 00:12:43,962
There are

186
00:12:43,963 --> 00:12:46,535
two seekers now.

187
00:12:48,999 --> 00:12:52,386
Is everybody in hiding?

188
00:12:52,695 --> 00:12:54,926
The search is back on.

189
00:13:05,647 --> 00:13:06,966
[SION’s phone rings]

190
00:13:10,611 --> 00:13:11,525
Hello.

191
00:13:11,526 --> 00:13:12,792
It's me. SAKUYA.

192
00:13:12,758 --> 00:13:13,822
Where are you?

193
00:13:14,169 --> 00:13:15,547
I’m currently captured.

194
00:13:15,548 --> 00:13:16,918
What?

195
00:13:16,919 --> 00:13:18,323
Hang up.

196
00:13:24,073 --> 00:13:27,070
[The seeker is getting closer to SION]

197
00:13:30,171 --> 00:13:33,452
[Grabs the lid tight and gets ready]

198
00:13:42,102 --> 00:13:45,958
[But the seeker heads upstairs instead]

199
00:13:48,663 --> 00:13:51,116
[Silent hallway with no noise at all]

200
00:14:00,563 --> 00:14:03,346
[The science room door blocked with a chair]

201
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:06,748
[RIKU ]
The seeker is right here.

202
00:14:07,126 --> 00:14:10,261
He's arrived.

203
00:14:10,262 --> 00:14:12,165
[RIKU]

204
00:14:20,118 --> 00:14:22,217
[The seeker breaks through the obstacle and enters]

205
00:14:25,185 --> 00:14:28,542
[RIKU]

206
00:14:54,937 --> 00:14:57,785
[Sound of the seeker’s staff tapping the floor]

207
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:06,399
[The seeker leaves without noticing RIKU]

208
00:15:09,913 --> 00:15:13,358
I told SION earlier I wasn’t scared.

209
00:15:13,359 --> 00:15:14,357
But now I am a bit.

210
00:15:14,358 --> 00:15:16,519
Sorry, SION.

211
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,965
I feel kinda scared.

212
00:15:17,966 --> 00:15:20,164
[Sound of swallowing]

213
00:15:20,396 --> 00:15:22,905
[Meanwhile in the confinement room]

214
00:15:23,268 --> 00:15:29,095
[SAKUYA can only escape if everything but “WISH” is erased]

215
00:15:35,336 --> 00:15:36,478
WITSHI.

216
00:15:36,479 --> 00:15:37,663
ASHI.

217
00:15:37,664 --> 00:15:38,689
OSHI.

218
00:15:38,690 --> 00:15:39,626
YUSHI

219
00:15:42,622 --> 00:15:44,465
WITSHI, maybe WIS…

220
00:15:51,837 --> 00:15:53,533
What’s “WISH” supposed to be?

221
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:57,303
‘Remove all words except “WISH”’

222
00:15:58,393 --> 00:16:00,139
Things like “ASHI” or “USHI.”

223
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:02,303
That’s not “WISH.”

224
00:16:02,304 --> 00:16:03,244
That one says “WITSHI.”

225
00:16:03,731 --> 00:16:05,960
Don’t I need to erase one more?

226
00:16:05,961 --> 00:16:07,820
[Completes the task by erasing “WITSHI” too]

227
00:16:08,067 --> 00:16:09,940
I’ve finished.

228
00:16:15,558 --> 00:16:16,641
Fighting.

229
00:16:16,972 --> 00:16:18,742
I think the seeker is nearby.

230
00:16:18,743 --> 00:16:20,467
– Yeah.
– I heard them earlier.

231
00:16:21,478 --> 00:16:24,880
[Sound of seeker’s cane hitting the floor]

232
00:16:26,325 --> 00:16:28,468
The seeker is here.

233
00:16:32,419 --> 00:16:35,574
[Takes a sneaky photo to confirm]

234
00:16:35,575 --> 00:16:37,513
Wait, hold on.

235
00:16:47,586 --> 00:16:50,946
[SAKUYA exits the confinement room for now]

236
00:16:57,447 --> 00:16:59,870
[Cane sound from the seeker]

237
00:16:59,871 --> 00:17:05,185
[Learning Center 3F, Seeker / 2F, SION, SAKUYA]

238
00:17:12,561 --> 00:17:15,640
[He spot the seeker and run to the lab]

239
00:17:24,325 --> 00:17:30,976
[Lab 3F, SAKUYA]

240
00:17:30,977 --> 00:17:34,132
[But another seeker is already in the lab]

241
00:17:38,125 --> 00:17:41,060
[SAKUYA enters the third-floor lab]

242
00:17:46,592 --> 00:17:48,769
[Some strange sounds in the room]

243
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:54,646
[Climbs up onto the window frame behind the blinds]

244
00:17:59,747 --> 00:18:04,793
[Lab 3F, SAKUYA]

245
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,380
[At the same moment in the Learning Center]

246
00:18:19,895 --> 00:18:22,591
[SION]

247
00:18:24,052 --> 00:18:25,759
He's coming.

248
00:18:41,401 --> 00:18:43,764
[The seeker stops in front of the trash bin]

249
00:18:50,853 --> 00:18:55,613
[The lid...]

250
00:18:55,614 --> 00:18:57,883
[Opened it?]

251
00:19:01,285 --> 00:19:03,731
[Found you! SION]

252
00:19:04,039 --> 00:19:05,735
Seriously...

253
00:19:06,354 --> 00:19:07,906
I should’ve just kept running around.

254
00:19:07,907 --> 00:19:10,446
[SION]

255
00:19:13,695 --> 00:19:14,759
RYO, you got caught?

256
00:19:14,923 --> 00:19:16,258
I got caught once.

257
00:19:16,259 --> 00:19:17,555
Aren’t you escaping?

258
00:19:18,150 --> 00:19:19,386
Why not?

259
00:19:19,748 --> 00:19:21,588
Isn’t that better anyway?

260
00:19:21,589 --> 00:19:22,982
You’re right about that.

261
00:19:23,551 --> 00:19:24,356
Two of them?

262
00:19:24,357 --> 00:19:25,444
The seekers?

263
00:19:25,445 --> 00:19:27,943
Yeah, but they seem to be moving separately.

264
00:19:28,776 --> 00:19:31,195
We’ve still got too much time left.

265
00:19:31,631 --> 00:19:33,172
What’s the issue, RYO?

266
00:19:33,112 --> 00:19:33,960
Just this.

267
00:19:33,961 --> 00:19:34,742
I just need to cut it.

268
00:19:34,743 --> 00:19:35,597
– Just cut it?
– Yeah.

269
00:19:37,205 --> 00:19:38,830
Cut some in advance.

270
00:19:38,831 --> 00:19:40,397
Hmm, that’s true.

271
00:19:40,398 --> 00:19:44,013
[Time left]

272
00:19:45,263 --> 00:19:48,120
JAEHEE and RIKU...

273
00:19:48,121 --> 00:19:49,744
Haven’t been caught yet?

274
00:19:49,745 --> 00:19:56,179
[Lab 3F, YUSHI]

275
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:59,589
[Lab 3F, SAKUYA]
[YUSHI and SAKUYA are both in the lab]

276
00:20:07,838 --> 00:20:10,080
[Lab 2F, JAEHEE]
[And JAEHEE too]

277
00:20:10,084 --> 00:20:11,831
[Practice Hall 2F, JAEHEE]
[And JAEHEE]

278
00:20:12,589 --> 00:20:14,653
I’m freaking out right now.

279
00:20:15,196 --> 00:20:17,775
I can hear the seeker coming down.

280
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,900
The sound here...

281
00:20:25,901 --> 00:20:28,516
It carries more than I thought.

282
00:20:28,517 --> 00:20:30,392
This school has zero soundproofing.

283
00:20:30,393 --> 00:20:33,232
So if I talk too loudly by mistake

284
00:20:33,191 --> 00:20:35,651
I'm bound to get caught.

285
00:20:40,488 --> 00:20:42,233
[The seeker reached JAEHEE’s hiding spot]

286
00:20:42,671 --> 00:20:44,284
Someone's approaching.

287
00:20:49,186 --> 00:20:52,496
He's knocking right next to me.

288
00:20:52,497 --> 00:20:55,660
I’m scared, please help me.

289
00:21:01,050 --> 00:21:04,115
Go away, please just go!

290
00:21:04,446 --> 00:21:06,639
Just leave already, please!

291
00:21:17,670 --> 00:21:21,081
[JAEHEE holds the doorknob tightly]

292
00:21:21,783 --> 00:21:24,420
[Sound of the seeker trying to open the door]

293
00:21:33,233 --> 00:21:36,168
[The seeker leaves, thinking the door is locked]

294
00:21:37,547 --> 00:21:38,938
[(Deep sigh)]

295
00:21:38,939 --> 00:21:41,675
I just had a showdown with the seeker.

296
00:21:41,676 --> 00:21:43,677
And I came out on top.

297
00:21:43,678 --> 00:21:48,563
I’ll stay hidden here till the very end.

298
00:21:48,564 --> 00:21:51,661
The seeker’s face...

299
00:21:51,662 --> 00:21:55,023
I really don’t want to see it again.

300
00:21:55,634 --> 00:21:58,203
YUSHI, RIKU, and JAEHEE haven’t been tagged once, right?

301
00:21:58,204 --> 00:21:59,158
Yeah.

302
00:21:59,159 --> 00:22:00,494
That’s impressive.

303
00:22:01,068 --> 00:22:03,954
But we really shouldn’t all gather.

304
00:22:03,955 --> 00:22:06,360
If we all get caught at once

305
00:22:06,361 --> 00:22:10,153
we won’t have time to run when seconds are left.

306
00:22:10,154 --> 00:22:12,514
I should call someone who’s never been caught.

307
00:22:18,472 --> 00:22:21,340
JAEHEE’s probably startled by the ringtone, right?

308
00:22:23,081 --> 00:22:26,629
The number you’ve dialed is unavailable...

309
00:22:28,263 --> 00:22:32,529
[JAEHEE’s phone didn’t ring]

310
00:22:37,043 --> 00:22:39,305
[The seeker moves faster than before]

311
00:22:48,358 --> 00:22:50,021
[Heading back toward SAKUYA]

312
00:22:50,022 --> 00:22:52,330
[SAKUYA]

313
00:23:04,395 --> 00:23:07,016
[Fails to find SAKUYA hiding behind the blinds and walks away]

314
00:23:16,339 --> 00:23:19,514
[Phone tapping sound]

315
00:23:20,649 --> 00:23:23,297
[Trying to make a call]

316
00:23:23,298 --> 00:23:25,953
[Hangs up quickly]

317
00:23:26,471 --> 00:23:28,486
[Sound of the seeker still nearby]

318
00:23:31,112 --> 00:23:35,497
[Phone ringtone]

319
00:23:54,227 --> 00:23:56,051
What the...

320
00:23:56,052 --> 00:23:57,627
What is going on?

321
00:23:57,628 --> 00:24:03,170
[SAKUYA]

322
00:24:03,171 --> 00:24:06,123
[Seeker moves decisively, having heard the ringtone]

323
00:24:30,865 --> 00:24:32,705
[Found you! SAKUYA]

324
00:24:35,065 --> 00:24:37,231
Please!

325
00:24:45,099 --> 00:24:46,045
Please!

326
00:24:48,698 --> 00:24:50,520
I’m sorry.

327
00:24:56,793 --> 00:25:00,412
[SAKUYA]

328
00:25:04,929 --> 00:25:06,465
You go too, quickly.

329
00:25:06,466 --> 00:25:07,325
Wait.

330
00:25:07,326 --> 00:25:09,019
No. RYO, wait.

331
00:25:09,020 --> 00:25:10,550
I really need to wait.

332
00:25:10,551 --> 00:25:11,979
RYO, you have to wait.

333
00:25:15,350 --> 00:25:16,692
This is terrifying.

334
00:25:18,049 --> 00:25:20,990
[Time remaining]

335
00:25:20,991 --> 00:25:22,670
If YUSHI gets caught, we’re in trouble.

336
00:25:22,671 --> 00:25:23,588
Exactly.

337
00:25:23,589 --> 00:25:24,882
YUSHI...

338
00:25:24,883 --> 00:25:27,150
He might not have the school supplies.

339
00:25:27,151 --> 00:25:29,576
RYO, you’re the key!

340
00:25:29,577 --> 00:25:30,732
If one more person gets caught here

341
00:25:30,733 --> 00:25:31,728
then you’ll have to run.

342
00:25:31,997 --> 00:25:34,774
[Will RYO be the key to victory?]

343
00:25:34,775 --> 00:25:37,361
[Practice Hall 3F, YUSHI]

344
00:25:39,677 --> 00:25:44,396
[Seekers moving around more urgently]

345
00:25:47,386 --> 00:25:50,133
[Seeker’s staff hitting the floor especially loud]

346
00:25:51,732 --> 00:25:53,952
[(Lights off)]

347
00:25:55,137 --> 00:25:58,042
[All seekers converge where YUSHI is hiding!]

348
00:26:04,442 --> 00:26:06,932
[YUSHI’s breathing sound]

349
00:26:06,933 --> 00:26:09,665
[YUSHI]

350
00:26:10,801 --> 00:26:14,035
[Found you! YUSHI]

351
00:26:14,036 --> 00:26:17,249
[YUSHI]

352
00:26:19,487 --> 00:26:21,580
[YUSHI is caught and brought to the confinement room right before the end]
It was YUSHI.

353
00:26:21,538 --> 00:26:23,085
Wait, YUSHI!

354
00:26:23,086 --> 00:26:24,251
Did you find the school supplies?

355
00:26:25,347 --> 00:26:26,539
You didn’t?

356
00:26:26,540 --> 00:26:27,942
Wait a second.

357
00:26:31,313 --> 00:26:36,793
[1 minute left until hide-and-seek ends]

358
00:26:40,634 --> 00:26:43,467
[Current survival rate, 33.33%]

359
00:26:44,024 --> 00:26:45,221
I should solve mine too.

360
00:26:45,452 --> 00:26:47,780
Do it now!

361
00:26:49,004 --> 00:26:50,661
Hurry!

362
00:26:50,906 --> 00:26:52,567
[Target survival rate, 50% / More than half must survive!]

363
00:26:58,562 --> 00:26:59,951
Hurry!

364
00:27:00,549 --> 00:27:03,465
[RYO solves the task]

365
00:27:05,766 --> 00:27:08,492
[Barely escapes in time]

366
00:27:08,908 --> 00:27:10,358
I’m scared.

367
00:27:17,616 --> 00:27:24,428
[Hide-and-seek ends]

368
00:27:30,541 --> 00:27:34,239
Olly olly oxen free!

369
00:27:40,967 --> 00:27:44,275
Olly olly oxen free!

370
00:27:57,780 --> 00:28:00,189
[The seekers disappear]

371
00:28:01,757 --> 00:28:05,076
[NCT WISH gathers in the confinement room]
Nice!

372
00:28:05,077 --> 00:28:06,073
Why isn’t JAEHEE here yet?

373
00:28:06,074 --> 00:28:07,244
JAEHEE did great too.

374
00:28:07,245 --> 00:28:08,368
JAEHEE really did well.

375
00:28:08,369 --> 00:28:09,834
Not getting caught even once is impressive.

376
00:28:09,835 --> 00:28:10,371
Exactly.

377
00:28:11,528 --> 00:28:13,022
[Call connecting tone]

378
00:28:13,023 --> 00:28:14,918
But why isn’t JAEHEE answering?

379
00:28:15,832 --> 00:28:18,190
JAEHEE’s still in game mode.

380
00:28:18,936 --> 00:28:20,870
[JAEHEE joins late]

381
00:28:20,871 --> 00:28:22,070
Grade 3, Class 7?

382
00:28:22,292 --> 00:28:24,178
JAEHEE, hurry! Why aren’t you picking up?

383
00:28:24,179 --> 00:28:25,166
You called?

384
00:28:25,167 --> 00:28:26,045
Huh?

385
00:28:26,046 --> 00:28:26,995
I didn’t get a call.

386
00:28:26,996 --> 00:28:28,112
I called like 30 times.

387
00:28:28,113 --> 00:28:29,162
Where were you hiding?

388
00:28:29,163 --> 00:28:30,216
A place no one could ever find.

389
00:28:30,217 --> 00:28:32,136
I was in this storage-like area.

390
00:28:32,137 --> 00:28:34,188
[Phone finally rings]
But now... I got a call! It’s ringing!

391
00:28:34,189 --> 00:28:37,197
[Looks like he was in a no-signal zone]
I guess I was in a spot with no reception.

392
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:39,707
Do you know how the seeker showed up at the start?

393
00:28:39,708 --> 00:28:41,620
I think when all the supplies were found

394
00:28:41,621 --> 00:28:43,568
the hide-and-seek seemed to start.

395
00:28:43,569 --> 00:28:45,554
I found a protractor on a poster and pulled it off.

396
00:28:45,555 --> 00:28:47,676
As soon as I pulled it, the poster tore and the seeker jumped out like, “Wah!”

397
00:28:50,198 --> 00:28:51,170
That seeker!

398
00:28:51,171 --> 00:28:52,371
The seeker?

399
00:28:52,372 --> 00:28:53,072
They were like, “Wah!”

400
00:28:53,073 --> 00:28:56,503
[JAEHEE triggered the start of hide-and-seek]
– Just like that.
– So that’s how it all started!

401
00:28:56,504 --> 00:28:59,372
Suddenly three people were running at me screaming.

402
00:28:59,373 --> 00:29:02,752
So I thought, “What’s this? Am I supposed to run?” and I bolted.

403
00:29:02,753 --> 00:29:05,223
SAKUYA, did you see his face while running?

404
00:29:06,930 --> 00:29:10,555
He looked absolutely terrified... seriously scary.

405
00:29:10,879 --> 00:29:12,877
[Phone notification sound]

406
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:18,243
[Hide-and-seek is over]
[If survival rate is over 50%, a snack gift is awarded to NCTzen]

407
00:29:18,244 --> 00:29:20,781
[NCT WISH achieved the target survival rate]

408
00:29:20,782 --> 00:29:22,246
Nice!

409
00:29:22,776 --> 00:29:24,056
It's a huge win.

410
00:29:24,057 --> 00:29:24,585
Totally.

411
00:29:24,586 --> 00:29:26,359
I was just thinking about the prize.

412
00:29:26,360 --> 00:29:29,391
I was so determined to survive because of that.
